WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.020
When the spare cable has its own work order, keep the repair and stock request as separate records.

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:13.020
Search from Link Related Ticket using the other number, select the matching title, and check that the linked number appears.

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:18.375
Open the link to verify its destination before telling a colleague the dependency is documented.
